#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/70161afe-8ace-4642-894a-cd21ed77a3b9-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-diagonalization/extracted-outputs/70161afe-8ace-4642-894a-cd21ed77a3b9-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Time evolution {#time-evolution}"
msgstr "Evolusi waktu {#time-evolution}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We can realize the time-evolution operator generated by a given Hamiltonian: $U=e^{-iHt}$ via the [Lie-Trotter approximation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter).\n"
msgstr "Kita dapat merealisasikan operator evolusi waktu yang dihasilkan oleh Hamiltonian tertentu: $U=e^{-iHt}$ melalui [aproksimasi Lie-Trotter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Hadamard test {#hadamard-test}"
msgstr "Uji Hadamard {#hadamard-test}"

# doq-bootstrap: dropped (table row count mismatch: source 0, translation 1): $$ \begin{equation*}     |0\rangle|0\rangle^N \quad\longrigh
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "![fig2.png](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-subspace-diagonalization/c5263851-6067-4ca2-8e0c-a835631cdc7f.avif)\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: dropped (table row count mismatch: source 1, translation 0): Di mana $P$ adalah salah satu suku dalam dekomposisi Hamilto
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"    |0\\rangle|0\\rangle^N \\quad\\longrightarrow\\quad \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(|0\\rangle + |1\\rangle \\Big)|0\\rangle^N \\quad\\longrightarrow\\quad \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(|0\\rangle|0\\rangle^N+|1\\rangle |\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big) \\quad\\longrightarrow\\quad \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(|0\\rangle |0\\rangle^N+|1\\rangle P |\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big) \\quad\\longrightarrow\\quad\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(|0\\rangle |\\psi_j\\rangle+|1\\rangle P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big)\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Where $P$ is one of the terms in the decomposition of the Hamiltonian $H=\\sum P$ and $\\text{Prep} \\; \\psi_i$, $\\text{Prep} \\; \\psi_j$ are controlled operations that prepare $|\\psi_i\\rangle$, $|\\psi_j\\rangle$ vectors of the unitary Krylov space, with $|\\psi_k\\rangle = e^{-i H k dt } \\vert \\psi \\rangle = e^{-i H k dt } U_{\\psi} \\vert 0 \\rangle^N$. To measure $X$, first apply $H$...\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"    \\longrightarrow\\quad\\frac{1}{2}|0\\rangle\\Big( |\\psi_j\\rangle + P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big) + \\frac{1}{2}|1\\rangle\\Big(|\\psi_j\\rangle - P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big)\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"    \\longrightarrow\\quad\\frac{1}{2}|0\\rangle\\Big( |\\psi_j\\rangle + P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big) + \\frac{1}{2}|1\\rangle\\Big(|\\psi_j\\rangle - P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big)\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "... kemudian ukur:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "... then measure:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\begin{split}\n"
"    \\Rightarrow\\quad\\langle X\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{4}\\Bigg(\\Big\\|| \\psi_j\\rangle + P|\\psi_i\\rangle \\Big\\|^2-\\Big\\||\\psi_j\\rangle - P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big\\|^2\\Bigg) \\\\\n"
"    &= \\text{Re}\\Big[\\langle\\psi_j| P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big].\n"
"\\end{split}\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\begin{split}\n"
"    \\Rightarrow\\quad\\langle X\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{4}\\Bigg(\\Big\\|| \\psi_j\\rangle + P|\\psi_i\\rangle \\Big\\|^2-\\Big\\||\\psi_j\\rangle - P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big\\|^2\\Bigg) \\\\\n"
"    &= \\text{Re}\\Big[\\langle\\psi_j| P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big].\n"
"\\end{split}\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "Dari identitas $|a + b\\|^2 = \\langle a + b | a + b \\rangle = \\|a\\|^2 + \\|b\\|^2 + 2\\text{Re}\\langle a | b \\rangle$. Demikian pula, mengukur $Y$ menghasilkan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"From the identity $|a + b\\|^2 = \\langle a + b | a + b \\rangle = \\|a\\|^2 + \\|b\\|^2 + 2\\text{Re}\\langle a | b \\rangle$. Similarly, measuring $Y$ yields\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"    \\langle Y\\rangle = \\text{Im}\\Big[\\langle\\psi_j| P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big].\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"    \\langle Y\\rangle = \\text{Im}\\Big[\\langle\\psi_j| P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big].\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

